d an opponent for your next live match.":"Toca arriba para encontrar un oponente para tu pr\xf3xima partida en directo.","Tap below to start a conversation with other Skillz Players!":"\xa1Presiona a continuaci\xf3n para comenzar una conversaci\xf3n con otros jugadores de Skillz!","Tap for player details":"Pulsar para ver detalles del jugador","Tap here to fix it":"Presiona aqu\xed para repararlo","Tap here to start chatting":"Presiona aqu\xed para comenzar a chatear","Tap the Play icon below to find your next opponent!":"Toca el icono de Jugar de abajo para encontrar a tu pr\xf3ximo oponente.","Tap the button below to start playing.":"Toca el bot\xf3n de abajo para empezar a jugar.","Tap the play button to pay {0} to compete for a {1} prize.":"Pulse el bot\xf3n jugar para pagar {0} para competir por un {1} premio.","Tap the {0}{1} tile above to select your stakes.":"Toca el icono {0}{1} de arriba para seleccionar tus apuestas.","Tap to Select Your Stakes":"Toca para Seleccionar tus Apuestas","Tap to select your stakes":"Toca para seleccionar tus apuestas","Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.":"T\xe9rminos de servicio y Pol\xedtica de privacidad.","Test Menu":"Men\xfa de pruebas","Thanks for adding me!":"\xa1Gracias por agregarme!","Thanks! Please rate us on the app store":"\xa1Gracias! Calif\xedcanos en el App Store.","That didn't work, please try again.":"Eso no funcion\xf3, intente de nuevo.","That doesn't seem like it worked. Please try again.":"Parece que eso no funcion\xf3. Intenta de nuevo.","The CVC number entered is invalid.":"El n\xfamero de CVC ingresado no es v\xe1lido.","The credit card number entered is invalid.":"El n\xfamero de tarjeta de cr\xe9dito ingresado no es v\xe1lido.","The expiration date entered is invalid.":"La fecha de vencimiento ingresada no es v\xe1lida.","The more you select, the faster you will find an opponent":"Cuantas m\xe1s selecciones, m\xe1s r\xe1pido encontrar\xe1s un oponente","The tournament has been cancelled.":"El torneo se ha cancelado.","The tournament has started.":"El torneo ha comenzado.","The tournament will begin at the start time if we reach {0} players.":"El torneo empezar\xe1 a la hora de inicio si se llega a {0} jugadores.","The tournament will start in {0} and when {1} players have registered.":"El torneo empezar\xe1 el {0} y cuando se hayan registrado {1} jugadores.","The verification code provided is invalid.":"El c\xf3digo de verificaci\xf3n que proporcion\xf3 no es v\xe1lido.","The zip code entered is invalid.":"El c\xf3digo postal ingresado no es v\xe1lido.","There has been an error":"Se ha producido un error","There was an error processing your transaction. Please try again.":"Se ha producido un error al procesar tu transacci\xf3n. Vuelve a intentarlo.","This bar shows your progress towards the next tier. New tiers earned will be kept for the following month.":"Esta barra indica tu progreso con respecto al pr\xf3ximo nivel. Los nuevos niveles obtenidos se mantendr\xe1n para el mes siguiente.","This can't be blank":"Este campo no puede estar en blanco","This conversation includes players you've blocked. You will not see their messages unless you unblock them.":"Esta conversaci\xf3n incluye jugadores que usted ha bloqueado. Usted no podr\xe1 ver sus mensajes a menos que los desbloquee.","This email has already been added.":"Este correo electr\xf3nico ya se ha a\xf1adido.","This is taking longer than expected. Please try again later.":"Esto est\xe1 tardando m\xe1s de lo esperado. Intente de nuevo m\xe1s tarde.","This is your Bonus Cash reward for inputting a promo code. Bonus Cash can be used to pay entry fees and compete for prizes, but cannot be withdrawn.":"Esta es tu recompensa de bonificaci\xf3n de dinero por introducir un c\xf3digo de promoci\xf3n. La bonificaci\xf3n de dinero se puede usar para pagar las cuotas de admisi\xf3n y competir por premios, pero no se puede retirar.","This match is not currently supported over cellular. Please connect to wifi and retry.":"Actualmente, esta partida no es compatible con el celular. Con\xe9ctate a wifi e intenta de nuevo.","This message was not delivered.":"Este mensaje no se ha entregado.","This offer is unredeemable at this time, try again later.":"Esta oferta no se puede canjear en este momento. Int\xe9ntelo de nuevo m\xe1s tarde.","This phone number is already associated with another account. Please enter another phone number and try again.":"Este n\xfamero de tel\xe9fono ya est\xe1 asociado a otra cuenta. Vuelve a intentarlo con otro n\xfamero de tel\xe9fono.","This room is muted. You will not receive any notifications until it is unmuted.":"Esta sala est\xe1 silenciada. No recibir\xe1s ninguna notificaci\xf3n hasta que se desactive.","This username already exists or is invalid.":"Este nombre de usuario ya existe o no es v\xe1lido.",Ticketz:"Ticketz","Ticketz Tiers":"Niveles de Ticketz",Tier:"Nivel","Tier Details":"Detalles del nivel","Tier Retention":"Retenci\xf3n del nivel",Time:"Tiempo","Time For Another Match":"Hora para otra partida","Time Left":"Tiempo restante","Time to get back in the game.":"Hora de regresar al juego.",Title:"T\xedtulo","To Be Determined":"Se determinar\xe1","To claim a prize, save your Skillz account before the tournament concludes.":"Para reclamar un premio, guarde su cuenta de Skillz antes de que el torneo finalice.","To compete for cool prizes, contact our support team, and access great customer rewards, please save your account.":"Para competir por excelentes premios, p\xf3ngase en contacto con el equipo de soporte y acceda a grandes recompensas para clientes. Guarde su cuenta.","To ensure the safety of your account, Skillz would like to confirm the following:":"Para garantizar la seguridad de tu cuenta, Skillz quiere confirmar lo siguiente:","To join this tournament, enable location services in your settings.":"Para unirte a este torneo, habilita los servicios de localizaci\xf3n en tu configuraci\xf3n.",Today:"Hoy",Tomorrow:"Ma\xf1ana","Top {0}":