s lower than recommended. If you disconnect during the match, you will forfeit your entry fee. Do you want to continue?":"La intensidad de su se\xf1al es m\xe1s baja de lo recomendado. Si se desconecta durante la partida, perder\xe1 su cuota de admisi\xf3n. \xbfDesea continuar?","Your connection strength is too weak to play this match.":"La intensidad de la conexi\xf3n es muy d\xe9bil para que juegue esta partida.","Your connection strength is too weak to play this match. Please connect to wifi or find a stronger signal.":"La intensidad de la conexi\xf3n es muy d\xe9bil para que juegue esta partida. Con\xe9ctese a wifi o busque una se\xf1al m\xe1s fuerte.","Your deposit could not be processed at this time":"No hemos podido tramitar tu dep\xf3sito en este momento","Your deposit has been received!":"\xa1Recibimos su dep\xf3sito!","Your entered passwords do not match":"Las contrase\xf1as ingresadas no coinciden","Your entries have been purchased!":"Sus accesos se compraron","Your entry fee has been refunded for:":"Se te ha reembolsado tu cuota de admisi\xf3n","Your event":"Tu evento","Your event begins in {0}, would you like to be notified when it starts?":"Tu evento comienza en {0}, \xbfdeseas recibir una notificaci\xf3n cuando comience?","Your event is now live!\\n\\nInvite more players using\\nthe match code:\\n":"\xa1Tu evento ya est\xe1 en marcha!\\n\\nInvita a m\xe1s jugadores usando\\nel c\xf3digo de partida:\\n","Your free entries will be used first.":"Tus entradas gratuitas se utilizar\xe1n primero.","Your friends are on Skillz! Tap add to send them a friend request.":"\xa1Tus amigos est\xe1n en Skillz! Presiona Agregar para enviarles una solicitud de amistad.","Your hard work has earned you a {0}X Ticketz multiplier. Check out Skillz Rewards to redeem Ticketz for amazing prizes!":"Tu esfuerzo te ha hecho ganar un multiplicador de Ticketz de x{0}. \xa1Consulta las recompensas de Skillz para canjear Ticketz por incre\xedbles premios!","Your level represents all